B.arl=s(["Tria per ordre. 1r = {a} pts, 2n = {b}, 3r = {c}. No et pots votar. Qui m\xe9s sumi \xe9s l'MVP.","Escolle por orde. 1.\xba = {a} pts, 2.\xba = {b}, 3.\xba = {c}. Non podes votarte. Quen m\xe1is sume \xe9 o MVP.","Aukeratu ordenean. 1.a = {a} pt, 2.a = {b}, 3.a = {c}. Ezin duzu zeure burua bozkatu. Gehien batzen duena da MVPa.","Pick in order. 1st = {a} pts, 2nd = {b}, 3rd = {c}. You can't vote for yourself. Whoever scores most is the MVP.","W\xe4hle der Reihe nach. 1. = {a} Pkt., 2. = {b}, 3. = {c}. Du kannst dich nicht selbst w\xe4hlen. Wer am meisten sammelt, ist MVP.","Scegli in ordine. 1\xba = {a} pt, 2\xba = {b}, 3\xba = {c}. Non puoi votarti. Chi somma di pi\xf9 \xe8 l'MVP.","Kies op volgorde. 1e = {a} ptn, 2e = {b}, 3e = {c}. Je kunt niet op jezelf stemmen. Wie het meest scoort is MVP.","Choisis dans l'ordre. 1er = {a} pts, 2e = {b}, 3e = {c}. Tu ne peux pas voter pour toi. Celui qui totalise le plus est le MVP."],t.s)
