B.aPE=s(["Segons la modalitat, l'app proposa les regles est\xe0ndard (cessi\xf3, serveis, canvis\u2026).","Segundo a modalidade, a app prop\xf3n as regras est\xe1ndar (cesi\xf3n, saques, cambios\u2026).","Modalitatearen arabera, aplikazioak arau estandarrak proposatzen ditu (lagapena, sakeak, aldaketak\u2026).","Depending on the format, the app suggests standard rules (back-pass, throw-ins, subs\u2026).","Je nach Spielform schl\xe4gt die App Standardregeln vor (R\xfcckpass, Einw\xfcrfe, Wechsel\u2026).","In base alla modalit\xe0, l'app propone le regole standard (retropassaggio, rimesse, cambi\u2026).","Afhankelijk van de spelvorm stelt de app standaardregels voor (terugspeelbal, ingooien, wissels\u2026).","Selon le format, l'appli propose les r\xe8gles standard (passe en retrait, touches, changements\u2026)."],t.s)
